      "role": "user",
      "content": "I'm struggling a bit with the relationship between the harmonic series and timbre in woodwind instruments. Specifically, when looking at a flute, how do the higher partials actually influence the perceived quality of the sound, rather than just the pitch?",
      "source": "evaluator"
    },
